# The link mark at the head of the footer's status line: amber while the radio is still
# replaying its roster, green once it has, and the two arrows lighting as frames cross the link
# and going out again on their own.
scene demo
scale 4
delay 120
config

syncing on
hold 400
traffic in
traffic in
traffic in
syncing off
hold 700
traffic out
frame
frame
frame
frame
frame
frame
traffic in
frame
frame
traffic out
traffic in
frame
frame
frame
frame
frame
frame
hold 600
